{"about_the_game":"<strong>Lorne is a third person adventure game set in a beautiful open world.<br><br>You are a ranger of Lorne, who has to build a bastion to withstand the coming invasion. Survive wave after wave of attackers and keep improving your defenses. Can you defeat all 3 Vassals of Evil?<br><br>Explore the world of Lorne for hidden artifacts that unlocks new powers and technologies. Improve your bastion and keep the people safe, no matter the cost. <br><br>No Pressure.</strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172970/extras/f41e4d4f8e09c489bf6709e15a212c7a.poster.avif?t=1719566713\" width=520 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172970/extras/f41e4d4f8e09c489bf6709e15a212c7a.webm?t=1719566713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172970/extras/f41e4d4f8e09c489bf6709e15a212c7a.mp4?t=1719566713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>DO YOUR DUTY AS A RANGER</li></ul></strong><br>Do what you need to do in order to protect Lorne. As a ranger you investigate conflicts, uncover mysteries or find ways to take down dangerous mythical creatures. You guard the borders and roam the lands, all to keep the peace of Lorne.<br><br><strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>CRAFT POWERFUL ARTIFACTS </li></ul></strong><br>In Lorne you have to do whatever you can to become strong enough to defend your home. Craft items with resources you have harvested from the world. Upgrade your abilities with soul fragments, found from defeating powerful foes. Explore the world and find ancient trinkets that provide you with untold power.<br><br><strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>BUILD A BASTION OF JUSTICE</li></ul></strong><br>Claim land and create a base, tailored for the perfect defense. Upgrade, and design your own own fortifications. withstand wave after wave crashing over your ramparts.<br><br><strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>SURVIVE THE INVASION</li></ul></strong><br>Once you start the game the clock is ticking. The invasion is coming and each wave is a little bit stronger than the previous one. Siege Ogres, Evil Mages, Dragons and hordes of Undead. The enemy forces is after one thing, the total destruction of Lorne<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172970/extras/65e9fb01ebc04e89b879a2fc6ae2db23.poster.avif?t=1719566713\" width=520 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172970/extras/65e9fb01ebc04e89b879a2fc6ae2db23.webm?t=1719566713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172970/extras/65e9fb01ebc04e89b879a2fc6ae2db23.mp4?t=1719566713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2172970?t=1719566713","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172970/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1719566713","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172970/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1719566713","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172970/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1719566713","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2805400,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<strong>Lorne is a third person adventure game set in a beautiful open world.<br><br>You are a ranger of Lor